{
  "server": "cn",
  "storyId": "main_9_level_main_09-17_beg",
  "groupId": "main_9",
  "stageId": "main_09-17",
  "title": "长夜枪火",
  "storyCode": "9-19",
  "avgTag": "行动前",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_09-17_beg.txt",
  "sourceHash": "21520cf383fe6480a99a8e0d5300ceec7925b90a7068ba4ee726e23e5e7d08fe",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "21_G5_victoria_street_n_ruins"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿赫茉妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_228_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "除了最后几个地方，小丘郡里已经都是我们的人了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿赫茉妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_228_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "和料想的一样，驻军并没有猜到我们把实力藏到了后面。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿赫茉妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_228_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你注意到他们刚刚的眼神了么？本应被摧毁殆尽的部队再一次出现在面前，他们还以为自己见到了真正的亡灵。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿赫茉妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_228_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "在欢呼胜利的时候遭遇最沉重的打击，几乎没有维多利亚士兵还剩下战斗的意志——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿赫茉妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_228_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啧，差点忘了，我的好同学们还在城郊负隅顽抗。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿赫茉妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_228_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "真是可怜，挣扎到现在，还是什么都改变不了。就算我们不出手，他们也早就被腐朽的军队本身拖得精疲力尽。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿赫茉妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_228_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "蔓德拉去找他们了。她一个人足够应付。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿赫茉妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_228_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "一切看起来都在按我们的计划进行——除了一件事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿赫茉妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_228_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......拉芙希妮跑了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_236",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这么说，我的仆臣们失败了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿赫茉妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_228_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "说不惊讶是假的。他们虽然都是傻子，但实力都不弱。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿赫茉妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_228_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不过——我们也不再需要他们了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿赫茉妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_228_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他们的野心膨胀得太快，为了谋取自己的利益，一味地急着让战火蔓延开去，甚至妄图利用拉芙希妮，来瞒着你偷偷行事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿赫茉妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_228_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "到头来，被自己的欲望之火吞噬，也算给我们省力气了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_236",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那么你呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿赫茉妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_228_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......咳，咳咳......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿赫茉妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_228_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿赫茉妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_228_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你知道我的，我只是想看见......终点。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿赫茉妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_228_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "在我们第一次相遇的时候，我就这么问过你——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿赫茉妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_228_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "既然生的终点注定是死，秩序无论重建多少回都必然崩溃，那走在路上的人们，是如何忍受一次又一次无谓的选择的呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿赫茉妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_228_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "而你......你向我伸出了手。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿赫茉妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_228_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你让我看见了本该寂灭的魂灵在死之后仍能跃动。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿赫茉妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_228_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "自那以后，我就一直想亲眼看一看，在火烧穿一切之后，这片大地会是什么样貌。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_236",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "很贪心，也很诚实。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿赫茉妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_228_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哈......我和那些蠢人最大的差别，就是我明白该在什么时候撒谎。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿赫茉妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_228_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "所以说，拉芙希妮的事怎么处理？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_236",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我的妹妹，她选了谁？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿赫茉妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_228_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "救她的人身份不明，只是，他们在城里救了很多人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿赫茉妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_228_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "大概是......一个医疗方面的救援组织？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿赫茉妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_228_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "实话说，我很好奇。他们看起来和任何一个国家的力量都没什么关系，我搞不明白他们为何要和我们作对。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_236",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呵呵，听着很有趣。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿赫茉妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_228_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "要我找人跟上去吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_236",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你来决定吧，我的谋臣。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_236",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "当然，或许有一天，我会想亲自见见他们。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "21_G5_victoria_street_n_ruins"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿赫茉妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_228_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "传令下去，我们的目标只有维多利亚士兵，要是再有人对居民动手，那他就是深池的敌人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深池士兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_244",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是，女士。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深池士兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_244",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不过，不是所有居民都站在我们这边。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿赫茉妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_228_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "首先他们得相信我们是站在他们一边的，不是吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿赫茉妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_228_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "在经历了这么大的创伤之后，人们需要的是帮助，而非更加严格的管控。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿赫茉妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_228_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "对了，也不许对救援者下手——至少在小丘郡、在居民面前时不可以。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿赫茉妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_228_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "火已经烧得够旺了，差不多该熄了，不然烧到最后什么都没剩下，我们也就白忙活了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿赫茉妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_228_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "很快，等伤口愈合，人们会记得是谁残忍地伤害了他们，又是谁把他们拉出了地狱。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿赫茉妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_228_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "深池战士和维多利亚士兵不一样——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿赫茉妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_228_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这个念头会伴随着伤疤一起，永远刻上死后复生的城市的心脏。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深池士兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_244",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......那外面的人呢？我们现在收手的话，他们能看到吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿赫茉妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_228_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "想看的人早就看到了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深池士兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_244",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这样就够了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿赫茉妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_228_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "当然，你以为我们做这一切是为了什么？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿赫茉妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_228_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "为塔拉人出口气？这话你信？你跟我都和塔拉一磅关系都没有。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿赫茉妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_228_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "占领小丘郡？愚蠢自大的小丑才会这么想。维多利亚是摇摇欲坠，但随便哪个大公爵的军队都能轻松地把一座移动城市碾成灰。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿赫茉妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_228_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我们目前要做的，仅仅只是确保这把火能烧起来，烧得让整个维多利亚都看在眼里。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿赫茉妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_228_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "火光里，有的人闻见了利益，有的人宣泄了仇恨，有的人找到了信仰——这算不算某种程度上的皆大欢喜？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿赫茉妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_228_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "走吧，去办最后一件事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿赫茉妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_228_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "等做完该做的，我们也该离场了，叛徒老在台面上蹦跶，就比小丑还可恨了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿赫茉妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_228_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "在下次登场之前，乖乖回到维多利亚为自己筑好的坟墓里，这才是鬼魂部队该做的事——你说是不是啊，希尔？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "21_G2_opera_room"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "“城区全部沦陷，通讯信号丢失，无法与各队联络......”\n“敌军正在涌向基地，火力差距太明显，我们挡不了多久了！”\n“报告......”\n“呼叫指挥中心，请立刻撤退，请立刻撤退，请——啊啊啊啊！”"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "汉密尔顿上校",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_227_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "维多利亚士兵",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "上校！我们该走了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "维多利亚士兵",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这地方马上就会被攻破，敌人已经包围了我们——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "汉密尔顿上校",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_227_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......走？走去哪里？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "维多利亚士兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_241",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "先逃出去再说！小丘郡没了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "汉密尔顿上校",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_227_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "没了？你*维多利亚粗口*给我闭嘴！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "汉密尔顿上校",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_227_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "只要有我在，这座城市就不会丢，永远都是维多利亚的小丘郡！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "维多利亚士兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_241",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "敌人不会放过您的，上校，他们不放过任何维多利亚士兵......您还是跟我们一块撤吧！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "汉密尔顿上校",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_227_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "汉密尔顿上校",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_227_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你走吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "维多利亚士兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_241",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "上校——！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "汉密尔顿上校",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_227_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "还站着干什么？逃吧，夹紧你的尾巴，从这里低着头逃出去！别再让我看到你——除非你更想死在我手里！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "维多利亚士兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_241",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......好，那我们走了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "维多利亚士兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_241",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "您......您保重！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "汉密尔顿上校",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_227_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......哈。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "汉密尔顿上校",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_227_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "保重？在战场上？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "汉密尔顿上校",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_227_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这从来不是一名军人该做的事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "汉密尔顿上校",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_227_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——我的刀呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "汉密尔顿上校",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_227_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "在这里啊，老朋友......自从离开高速战舰，你有多久没闻到硝烟味了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "黑暗中，上校从自己的椅子上站起来，理了理制服的领口，走向那扇门。\n他挺直脊背，拔出制式军刀，指向门外。\n火光涌了进来。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "“我和我的骑兵刀，来自维多利亚！”"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "21_G8_cammunibase"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "号角",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_229_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "双簧管，我和大提琴已到通讯塔下！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "号角",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_229_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你们那边怎么样？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "双簧管",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_229_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "队长，一到七号平台的炸药都已经埋好，就等着敌人过来！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "号角",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_229_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好，先从一号开始——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "号角",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_229_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "很好，敌人被引过去了！你们注意转移！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "号角",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_229_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "大提琴，登塔！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "号角",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_229_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "双簧管，二至三号爆破！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "号角",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_229_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......双簧管，我看到有更多术师在往通道那边过去，你们要小心！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "号角",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_229_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "注意这些术师的攻击手段，我侦测到很强的能量在积聚——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "号角",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_229_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "和敌人保持距离！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "号角",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_229_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "号角",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_229_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不，立刻撤退！双簧管，带着你的人离开通道！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "号角",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_229_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "敌人的源石技艺作用范围太大，他们不准备找你们了，而是想用火球清扫全部平台！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "双簧管",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_229_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "知道了，队长。那就看看谁更快了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "号角",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_229_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "号角",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_229_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "双簧管......！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "号角",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_229_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "大提琴，双簧管为我们争取到了一点时间，你继续往上突进！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "号角",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_229_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "只要找到控制面板，就立刻把消息发出去！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "号角",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_229_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我会守在塔下，为你提供火力掩护。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "号角",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_229_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "五分钟。我保证，五分钟之内，我不会让一个敌人爬上通讯塔。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "号角",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_229_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "炮击，准备——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "号角",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_229_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......上面什么情况，大提琴？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大提琴",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_229_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "还差十米......唔呃......！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "号角",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_229_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "塔上还有敌人？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大提琴",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_229_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "有......弩手！在八点钟方向！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "号角",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_229_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......唔......敌人数量太多了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "号角",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_229_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "如果我过去，塔下就会失守......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "号角",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_229_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "瞄准失败......距离太远，超出我的射程！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大提琴",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_229_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "管不了这么多了......啊！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "号角",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_229_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不行，再这样下去，在碰到控制面板之前，你就会失血而死！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "号角",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_229_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "找掩体！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大提琴",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_229_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "拖着......也不行！队长，你肯定也......受伤了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "号角",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_229_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我没问题......咳......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大提琴",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_229_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "别骗我了，队长，现在第六分钟过去了。你那里有多少敌人？二十？三十？还是更多？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "号角",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_229_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大提琴",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_229_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是不是都没空说话了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大提琴",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_229_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "还有七米，我这就过去——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "号角",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_229_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......怎么样了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大提琴",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_229_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊......哈！队长，我没事！有人干掉了弩手！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "号角",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_229_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "什么？难道是......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "风笛",
      "speakerId": "avg_222_bpipe_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "队长！！！我来了——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "号角",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_229_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊......哈哈......这家伙......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "风笛",
      "speakerId": "avg_222_bpipe_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你们再撑一会！就一会！我先弄倒这几个喷火的敌人！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "号角",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_229_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "大提琴，趁风笛吸引火力，快！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大提琴",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_229_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......队长，我打开控制面板了！就差一点......点......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大提琴",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_229_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呃......！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "号角",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_229_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "大提琴？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大提琴",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_229_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "石......石......队长......小心......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "号角",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_229_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "怎么回事？！！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "风笛",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——队长！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "风笛扑向号角，两人滚到了一边。\n一根巨大的石柱迅速地从通讯塔上方落下，将号角原本所在的位置扎出一个深坑。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "风笛",
      "speakerId": "avg_222_bpipe_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这好好的平台上哪里来的石柱......？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "风笛",
      "speakerId": "avg_222_bpipe_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呃......是鬼魂部队的术师？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蔓德拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_233_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这是你们的人？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "风笛",
      "speakerId": "avg_222_bpipe_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你杀了大提琴！！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蔓德拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_233_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我不喜欢别人不经允许就碰我的东西。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "风笛",
      "speakerId": "avg_222_bpipe_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "什么叫你的东西？！明明是鬼魂部队入侵了小丘郡！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "号角",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_229_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蔓德拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_233_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呵......哈！一声招呼都不打就开炮？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蔓德拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_233_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这是你们维多利亚军队的礼节吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蔓德拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_233_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......你！你气昏头了吗？！没看到你的攻击对我来说根本不起作用？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "号角",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_229_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......碎石。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "号角",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_229_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（所有角度都没有弱点。）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "号角",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_229_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（在炮火近身之前，她就会调动周围的石块进行格挡。）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "风笛",
      "speakerId": "avg_222_bpipe_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（是她的源石技艺？）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "号角",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_229_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（......你看大提琴身上。）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "风笛",
      "speakerId": "avg_222_bpipe_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（这些伤口都是石锥造成的？而且凶器全部消失了......她既能操纵石块来防御，又能变出石头来攻击？）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "风笛",
      "speakerId": "avg_222_bpipe_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（那麻烦了。）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "号角",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_229_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（测试下她能做到什么地步。一定会有破绽。）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蔓德拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_233_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啧，我现在怀疑你是想自杀。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蔓德拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_233_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我的战士们早就把你的弹药消耗得差不多了。再这么轰下去，你很快就会失去进攻能力，只能空着手等死了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蔓德拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_233_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "阿赫茉妮那家伙，在我来之前还反复提醒，说你们有多么多么厉害。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蔓德拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_233_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哈，说什么这才是维多利亚军的真正样貌......看看你们，手足无措，退无可退，这就是皇家近卫学校优等生的实力？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蔓德拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_233_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我看和驻军差不多嘛......不堪一击！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "号角",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_229_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......你很讨厌维多利亚军人？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蔓德拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_233_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "猜错了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蔓德拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_233_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我不讨厌任何士兵。无论听谁的指挥，大家都是在战场上搏命的可怜人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蔓德拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_233_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我讨厌的是你们这样的人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蔓德拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_233_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不过只是有个好出身，就以为自己有资格把我们踩在脚底下——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蔓德拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_233_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......能有什么场景比看着你们反过来跪在我脚下更美妙呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蔓德拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_233_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "去吧，穿刺——！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蔓德拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_233_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "还有余力挡下我的攻击？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蔓德拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_233_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "鲁珀，你还挺能坚持的嘛，比你那些一见我就吓软了腿的贵族同僚要出息不少！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蔓德拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_233_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "还看不明白吗？你们根本没有机会！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蔓德拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_233_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "整个小丘郡都是我们的人，你们的人要么死了，要么一早向我们投降。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蔓德拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_233_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "顺带一提，你和你的小队一进入小丘郡，就从来没有离开过我们的视线。你的每一个举动，我都看得清清楚楚。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "号角",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_229_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唔......你们在驻军里安插了间谍？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蔓德拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_233_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你以为你的失败是因为运气不够，或者自己不够努力，判断失误，以至于错失良机？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蔓德拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_233_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你错了！命运从来没有站在你们一边！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蔓德拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_233_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "只因为——维多利亚已经抛弃了你们！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蔓德拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_233_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你们比那些一无所知地在战场上丢了性命的士兵还要可怜——你们甘愿为了维多利亚浴血奋战，却成了国家的弃卒！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "号角",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_229_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你的意思是......不仅仅是一个间谍......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "号角",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_229_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "有很多军队里的人......甚至高层......在支持你们？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "号角",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_229_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那......你们的领袖......目标是什么？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "号角",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_229_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "号角",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_229_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是维多利亚......的冠冕？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "号角",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_229_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "凭什......么？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蔓德拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_233_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "住口！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蔓德拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_233_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "就凭你——阿斯兰的附庸，也配质疑领袖的高贵？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "号角",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_229_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哈......哈哈......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蔓德拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_233_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你笑什么？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "号角",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_229_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我笑你，自相矛盾。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "号角",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_229_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "一边对高高在上的贵族和富人咬牙切齿，一边崇拜着你所谓的比任何人都高贵的“领袖”——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "号角",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_229_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "还有比这更好笑的笑话吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蔓德拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_233_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......你懂什么！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蔓德拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_233_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "领袖......领袖的高贵可不仅仅是血统！她......她又有力量，又温柔......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蔓德拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_233_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哈，我明白了。你想拖延时间，从我嘴里再套一点情报出来，对不对？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蔓德拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_233_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你以为你这些小伎俩能奏效？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蔓德拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_233_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哪怕我跟你说了一些不该说的话，又有什么关系呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蔓德拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_233_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你们永远都别想爬上这座通讯塔——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蔓德拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_233_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "而听到我这些话的人，不是死人，就是马上要死的人！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "号角",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_229_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......那你还得再努力一些，小菲林。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蔓德拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_233_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你......！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蔓德拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_233_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你是挺厉害的，你对武器的控制很精准。你一直在调整炮击的方向，想试探我的源石技艺有没有破绽。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蔓德拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_233_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "很遗憾——要是你没有受这么重的伤，弹药也更充足，你搞不好真能伤到我。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蔓德拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_233_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "就这样吧，闲谈时间该结束了——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "号角",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_229_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "就是现在！！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蔓德拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_233_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "什......么？石柱突然倒了......砸到了我......？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "风笛",
      "speakerId": "avg_222_bpipe_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "瞎比划了这么久，我胳膊都酸了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蔓德拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_233_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那个瓦伊凡......！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蔓德拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_233_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我还以为她是在胡乱攻击，没想到她的目标并不是我，始终都是塔下的石柱......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蔓德拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_233_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "该死......该死！你们怎么会知道？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "风笛",
      "speakerId": "avg_222_bpipe_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "队长，她周围的碎石没了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "号角",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_229_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......嗯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "风笛",
      "speakerId": "avg_222_bpipe_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "果然，我们的猜测是正确的，她的源石技艺虽然非常灵活，可在同一时间只能做一件事——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "风笛",
      "speakerId": "avg_222_bpipe_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "无论是转移碎石当护盾，还是释放这些石刺，只要在施法的间隙期，她就会有破绽！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "号角",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_229_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "趁现在石柱瞬间破坏了她的碎石盾——我们进攻！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
  "observedOperators": []
}
